  "solution": {
    "text": "As total charge on sphere is <math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></munderover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mi>&#960;r</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math><br />Charged enclosed in the sphere of radius <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math>&nbsp;<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />As force on <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math> is zero<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#949;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#949;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfr